orking robustly.\n\n\n**Proposing Next Steps**\n\nNow, I'm thinking about the user's request for a web interface. Should I transition to the Vercel deployment phase immediately? Or, would it be better to first focus on tuning the prompt or testing the pipeline with larger warehouse datasets? I'm leaning toward getting their input on this, given how well the data analysis has gone so far.\n\n\n"}
